# Track the Skill and its documentation. Research material stays local in research/.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/VERSION
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/RULES.md
!/STATUS.md
!/skills/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
/skills/*
!/skills/hypo-exp/
/skills/hypo-exp/**
!/skills/hypo-exp/**/
!/skills/hypo-exp/**/*.md
/docs/*
!/docs/设计.md
!/docs/评测.md
!/docs/使用.md
!/docs/需求/
/docs/需求/*
!/docs/需求/*.md
/scripts/*
!/scripts/build_release.py
!/scripts/scan_expression.py
__pycache__/
